	<section_number>60.2-529</section_number>
	<catch_line>Employer's benefit charges</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any employer's benefit charges for a given calendar year shall be the total of the "benefit charges" which, pursuant to the provisions of § 60.2-528, are deemed to be the responsibility of such employer.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 60-69; 1954, c. 203; 1962, c. 6; 1964, c. 3; 1968, c. 738, § 60.1-81; 1974, c. 466; 1977, c. 330; 1981, c. 606; 1986, c. 480.</history>
</law>
